flowchart TD
    A[Open /write] --> B[compose title, abstract, body, category, tags]
    B --> C{cover image?}
    C -->|yes| D[upload via multer to Cloudinary or local]
    C -->|no| E
    D --> E{submit choice}
    E -->|Save draft| F[POST isDraft=true - private]
    E -->|Publish| G[POST create - moderation scan synchronous]
    G --> H[status PENDING_REVIEW - visible to reviewers]
    F --> I[listed under Drafts in My Stories]
    H --> J[listed under In Review]
